The ttyrecs have already been mentioned. Also, on the nethack.alt.org
server, others can watch you play in real-time, and these people can
give you hints and advice through chat or e-mail. And if you have a
particularly good game and are facing a dire situation, you can always
paste your inventory and stats here in rgrn and ask for advice.

